TEXT 696 88 Left 3 ;*Keep the files 2N7000.lib and 2N7000.asy in the folder \nwhere your simulation file is located.\nOr, save these files in a common directory such as\n "Custom Models" and include its path in the \nLTspice search path.\nLTspice search path is accessible at the Menu:\nTools-->Settings
TEXT 712 456 Left 2 ;Use .op for DC operating point analysis,\n.ac for AC frequency response analysis,\nand .tran for transient analysis.\nFor enabling the respective analysis, right-click on the\nrespective statement and edit and click OK.
TEXT 712 664 Left 2 ;Try changing the amplitude of the input signal to 25 mV and 50 mV. \nAt what amplitude the output starts getting clipped/distorted?\nWhat is the amplification ratio?
